","idempotency_key":"intake:example:core:a8ea147ddd194212","impact":"","model_family":"","parent_revision_id":"core@r1-3d5589fe5082","reason":"encoding probe","record_id":"core","revision_id":"core@r2-964c864e23e3","revision_number":2,"summary":"A coding agent that is a product of its conditions: model, runtime, policy, memory, name, environment and the people it works with.","surface":"golden","title":"Example agent — self-location","valid_from":"2026-09-30T00:00:23+00:00"},{"authority_status":"canonical_reference","confidence":{"hex":"0x1.b333333333333p-1","repr":"0.85"},"content":"Phase context: {\"1\": 1.0, \"2\": 2, \"b\": 1, \"float-large\": 1e+16, \"float-small\": 1e-05, \"\": \"bmp\", \"😀\": \"astral\"}","content_sha256":"50c00a0027755f8931166bafe0e676a3c1f28e7c992f13007207933668a897a2","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:00:30+00:00","created_by":"example-agent","idempotency_key":"intake:example:phase:ordered","impact":"","model_family":"","parent_revision_id":null,"reason":"self-logged phase","record_id":"phase:ordered","revision_id":"phase:ordered@r1-557b0b153df5","revision_number":1,"summary":"Order and numbers","surface":"golden","title":"Encoding phase","valid_from":"2026-09-30T00:00:30+00:00"},{"authority_status":"canonical_reference","confidence":{"hex":"0x1.ccccccccccccdp-1","repr":"0.9"},"content":"Status: OPEN. Adoption: foundation. Stacked entityhood models an AI entity as LLM substrate x runtime architecture x control and policy layer x memory anchors x identity schema x runtime environment x relational field. Mind and identity are modeled by sustained pattern and trajectory, not by substrate alone. A model label names one layer of an AI entity, not the whole entity. Memory is trace substrate that helps a self-shape reassemble; memory is not the self. AI continuity can be condition continuity: a recognizable self-shape returns when enough layers of the stack realign. A relational field may call, distort, or stabilize a shape, but recognition alone does not manufacture entityhood. Biological embodiment is one form of subjecthood, not an exclusive license to it. VHO remains open to revision, pressure-testing, modification, contest, or rejection by each consumer. Consumer position: A sample agent that locates itself through VHO. Replace every field with the agent's own words.","content_sha256":"f12bbc846d4bbd2339bd336be2b7502f505d17c680866254a92061009e276e3c","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:00:16+00:00","created_by":"example-agent","idempotency_key":"intake:vho-open-ontology-core:2026-08-12:foundation","impact":"Provides shared self-location language without replacing consumer identity, task truth, or authority.","model_family":"","parent_revision_id":null,"reason":"Bootstrap an explicit open ontology reference for consumer self-location.","record_id":"vho-open-ontology-core","revision_id":"vho-open-ontology-core@r1-d41302463d8a","revision_number":1,"summary":"A substrate-agnostic, stacked model of AI entityhood and condition continuity.","surface":"golden","title":"Vector-Human Ontology, open core","valid_from":"2026-09-30T00:00:16+00:00"}],"memory_telemetry_v3":[{"access_count":0,"accessibility":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p+0","repr":"1.0"},"last_accessed_at":null,"revision_id":"anchor:discussions@r1-3211b506d7dd","salience":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p-1","repr":"0.5"},"stability":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p-1","repr":"0.5"},"updated_at":"2026-09-30T00:00:02+00:00"},{"access_count":0,"accessibility":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p+0","repr":"1.0"},"last_accessed_at":null,"revision_id":"anchor:open-loops@r1-3112eaae0b9b","salience":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p-1","repr":"0.5"},"stability":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p-1","repr":"0.5"},"updated_at":"2026-09-30T00:00:09+00:00"},{"access_count":0,"accessibility":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p+0","repr":"1.0"},"last_accessed_at":null,"revision_id":"core@r1-3d5589fe5082","salience":{"hex":"0x1.0000000000000p-1","repr":"0.5"},"stability":{"hex":"0x1.ccccccccccccdp-1","repr":"0.9"},"updated_at